{"title":"2012 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A square with side length 8 is cut in half, creating two congruent rectangles. What are the dimensions of one of these rectangles?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/4/57454b51bac02eedf113ea10fe89433dadbbd6bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 2\\ \\text{by}\\ 4\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ \\ 2\\ \\text{by}\\ 6\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ \\ 2\\ \\text{by}\\ 8\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 4\\ \\text{by}\\ 4\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 4\\ \\text{by}\\ 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"548\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Cutting the square in half will bisect one pair of sides while the other side will remain unchanged. Thus, the new square is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/e/09e35b79099fc525d6865f4330b99868d813ade1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{8}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"11\" height=\"37\" /> by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, or  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/2/e/52eb5b8fb387215b77ef3091f63a7491f7f00f05.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(E)}\\ 4\\ \\text{by}\\ 8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"91\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28CREATIVE_THINKING.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING)\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ib6LCvSLo7M\">https://youtu.be/ib6LCvSLo7M</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2012_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;ac